{"pageid":3469,"title":"Version 1.24.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.24.0</span>","revid":15584,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.24.0\">Version 1.24.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 13th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Plane\" title=\"Plane\">Plane Schematic</a> (1x1x0)</li>\n<li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Intersection_Wedge\" title=\"Intersection Wedge\">Intersection Wedge Schematic</a></li>\n<li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Angled_Corner_Cylinder_Wedge\" title=\"Angled Corner Cylinder Wedge\">Angled Corner Cylinder Wedge Schematic</a></li>\n<li>Added resizeable <a href=\"/wiki/Sliding_Door\" title=\"Sliding Door\">Sliding Door</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Crates now have Stat details</li>\n<li>Vinyl Players now have Stat details</li>\n<li>ACTUALLY removed Crash Dummy now... (kinder)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Crates can now drag ores</li>\n<li>Crates now wait for player data before welding</li>\n<li>Fixed Gramophone auto eject error, which was rendering Gramophone unusable.</li>\n<li>Fixed Vinyl length display in <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Statistic Tool</a></li>\n<li>Fixed client error from plot being unloaded</li>\n<li>Vehicles will now update speed if trailers are attached or detached whilst still driving</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163730\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursio